"Adjuster is a spell-heavy, easily customized class with huge variety within it."
"Hannah Elber was an A-rank Adjuster who stabilized and froze patches of reality."
"A Jakarta Adjuster does creative things with localized temperature shifts."
"Adjuster of Reality is a build-your-own mage class with a huge starting list of spells."
"Each choice pushes an Adjuster down narrower paths toward a unique specialty."
"The System locks a path in hard; pick Ice Over and little else is offered."
"Some Adjusters enhance their own bodies like Brutes; others shoot bolts of electricity."
"Almost everyone wants Adjuster, so it is rarely traded."
"It is one of the most complex classes to master."
"Hold My Hand Until Sunset is an unpopular Adjuster capture spell gluing hand to target."
"Adjusters usually start with at least three spells."
"Rare path offers exist, such as one skill and one spell reading and restoring an object's past."
"Singleton paths, subclasses and talents usually carry higher potential."
